Pinned revision: 7813e9119eb5fe681b6750b8a033a0490bca0941
Files fnmatch.c and fnmatch.h are unmodified from this revision.
../../ports/fnmatch-byte.c supplies the necessary MacRoman byte/C-locale
boundary and renames fnmatch. No matching algorithm rewrite, heap allocation,
recursive backtracking, permanent cache or Unicode conversion.
Named classes/ranges use ASCII/C byte ordering; high bytes match literally.
The empty locale_impl.h shim replaces an unused musl-private include.
Currently used only by external find: shell expansion remains unchanged.
